      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Modern AU&lt;br /&gt;Adora and Catra have grown up together at the Horde Military Academy- but when Adora decides to leave, will Catra ever be able to forgive her? And when Catra receives orders to kill Adora, will she be able to go through with it...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora glanced to where their hands were joined.&lt;br /&gt;â€œYou would do that for me?â€ Her voice was soft. Tentative.&lt;br /&gt;â€œAdora. I would do anything for you.â€&lt;br /&gt;And the scariest thing, Catra realised, was that she meant it. She truly would do anything for her.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
